hook-redactor tests/red_team.rs §1: pattern_redacts_jwt_inside_authorization_header.
Go keeps the specific JWT label and the scheme; Rust overwrites the whole header value with auth_header.
-- input --
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwibmFtZSI6IkpvaG4ifQ.SflKxwRJSMeKKF2QT4fwpMeJf36POk6yJV_adQssw5c
-- must_contain --
<redacted:jwt>
-- must_not_contain --
eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9
-- want --
Authorization: Bearer <redacted:jwt>
-- deviation --
overlap
